你提醒了我,她的飞机6个小时前起飞的…你干什么去了?
Which reminds me, her plane left 6 hours ago...Where have you been?

95
00:05:23,580 --> 00:05:26,240
德怀特:哦,我就站在那里,
Dwight: Well I stood there and I watched the vapor trail from her plane

96
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:26,820
望着她的飞机在空中留下的痕迹.
evaporate.

97
