104
00:05:50,700 --> 00:05:55,700
德怀特:是先锋派电影节的获奖影片-<梨树之死>
Dwight: And I saw the avant-garde film festival winner, death of an avocado.

105
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:57,840
杰森:让我猜猜,
