麦琪:真的吗?
Maggie: Are you sure?

118
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,700
克莉丝:反正有人最喜欢.
Chrissy: It's someone's favorite.

119
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:50,800
杰森:嘿…真不懂人们为什么不到摩茨晚会仓库看一看?
Jason: Hey...you know I don't know why more people don't shop down at

