杰森:哦,买东西的也不庆贺出.不是这个就是"杜卡基斯在88年".
Jason: Well the salesman wasn't sure.It's either that or Dukakis in 88.

126
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:19,200
麦琪:哦,亲爱的,抱歉我要说你就爱便宜货.
Maggie: Oh honey I'm sorry to insinuate that you were cheap.

127
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:23,080
杰森:没关系,接受你的抱歉.
Jason: All right apology accepted.No where's Ben?

128
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,300
哦,本呢?他说要帮我找以前剩下的蜡烛的.
He was supposed to help me find last years candles.

129
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:27,800
麦琪:哦,他和德怀特去买冰激凌了.
Maggie: Oh he and Dwight went to get more ice cream.

130
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,900
杰森:德怀特又来了?
Jason: Dwight 's here again?

131
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:31,800
麦琪:哦,亲爱的的,他思念开萝尔,他和孤独.
Maggie: Well honey he misses Carol and he's lonely.

132
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:35,300
杰森:是的,不过,好像这两天我转身就会发现德怀特.
Jason: Yeah but it seems the last couple of days every time I turn around I there's Dwight.

133
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:37,200
麦琪:杰森,你太夸张了.
Maggie: Jason, you are exaggerating.

134
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:40,860
杰森:昨天晚上,我在洗手间看报纸,
Jason: Last night he was reading the newspaper over my shoulder,

135
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:42,300
他就在我的背后看.
in the bathroom.

136
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:47,400
麦琪:别管他了…另外,他和本相处地很不错.
Maggie: Leave him alone...besides he and Ben are really starting to get along.

137
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:52,480
德怀特:草坪上的躺椅象征着人类无法解决的难题--人的存在.
Dwight: So you see the lawn chair symbolizes the anthropological conundrum

138
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,740
that is this very existence.

139
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,800
本:太棒了,德怀特,我自己就永远说不出这样的话.不过,该把开萝尔叫回来了.
Ben: That's great Dwight.I never thought I'd hear my self say these words, but

140
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,420
get Carol back now

141
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:07,320
