巴尼:哦,我会告诉你的…这比你上次生日可强多了,是不是,亚伯?
Barney: Well, ill tell ya...this is a lot better than your last birthday uh Abe?

160
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:19,800
麦琪:上次怎么了?
Maggie: Why what happened?

161
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:24,540
