Barney: Hey come on, there probably wondering where we are...

280
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:36,000
他们一定在想我们去哪儿了…这会功夫能砍一棵树.我们走.
we could have chopped the whole tree down by now, let's go.

281
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:44,000
亚伯:别逼我叫警察.
Abe: Don't make me call the cops.

282
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:46,880
巴尼:我不会相信的.
Barney: I don't believe you.

283
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:50,120
你穿着考究的衣服站在我面前.
You stand there in those designer clothes,

284
00:16:50,140 --> 00:16:52,200
现在你告诉偷东西是错误的?
and now you tell me it's wrong to steal?

285
00:16:54,600 --> 00:17:02,100
你认为你18岁以后会怎么样?他们有四个孩子.幻想着他们能给你车?
What do you think is going to happen to you when you turn 18?They got four kids.Think they are going to get you a car?

286
00:17:04,220 --> 00:17:05,400
指望送你上大学?
Think that they are going to send you to college?

287
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:09,700
两年以后你会重新流落街头.
Two years from now, you are going to be back out on the street.

288
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,200
你不属于他们;你属于我们,
Your not one of them, you're one of us.

289
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:16,100
你清楚,我也清楚,
You know it, and I know it.

290
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:20,040
所以我说你不会叫警察,对吗?
And that's why your not going to call the cops, are you?

291
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:28,500
亚伯:是的.
Abe: No.

292
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:35,640
巴尼:亚伯,好了,我不想看到你这样.我有个办法解决这个问题.我们玩"三张牌"的游戏决定戒指的归属.
Barney: Abe, come on, I don't like to see you like this.I'll tell you

293
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,000
what were going to do.We will play 3 card Monty for the ring

294
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,900
或许你能公平的赢回戒指,
And maybe you can win it back from me fair and square.

295
00:17:39,900 --> 00:17:42,200
亚伯:这怎么是公平呢?总是你赢.
Abe: What's fair about that?You always win.

296
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:46,420
巴尼:我照顾你,给你三次机会.
Barney: I'll up the odds.I'll give you three tries.

297
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:49,200
你只要猜对Q,戒指归你.
Find the queen just once, you get the ring.

298
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:51,500
亚伯:如果我同意呢?
Abe: And if I don't?

299
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:54,900
巴尼:不然,我就可以一个月都不用担心吃饭了.
Barney: I get to eat regular for a few months.

300
00:17:54,900 --> 00:18:05,100
亚伯:不,我不能用西沃太太的戒指跟你打赌.
Abe: No, I can't gamble with you for Mrs.Seaver's ring.

301
00:18:05,100 --> 00:18:09,900
每个人:哦,大鼻子…大鼻子,芭芭拉…
Everybody: Uh, big nose...big nose, bob hope, Barbara Streisand...

302
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:13,300
迈克:匹诺曹.对了,我猜着了.
Mike: Pinocchio.Yeah, I got it.

303
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:16,000
杰森:等等,这里是说危险的联络.
Jason: Wait a minute, this says dangerous liaison.

304
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:18,300
克莉丝:我更喜欢匹诺曹.
Chrissy: I like Pinocchio better.

305
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:23,000
巴尼:好了,伙计们,我不该吃了就走.不过,我要回去了.
Barney: Well folks, I hate to eat and run but I got to get back into town.

306
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:28,200
亚伯:嘿,巴尼,我想我们来玩"三张牌"游戏吧.
Abe: Hey Barney, I thought we were going to play a little three card Monty.

307
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,500
巴尼:你真想玩?
Barney: You wanna play?

308
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:31,000
亚伯:我说了.
Abe: I said so.

309
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,200
巴尼:好,那好吧.
Barney: Well, all right.

310
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:33,900
麦琪:哦,好.
Maggie: Oh good.

311
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:36,600
本:哦,别生气,卢克.我押巴尼赢.
Ben: Oh no offense, but my money is on Barney.

312
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:39,200
杰森:我也是.
Jason: Me too.

313
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:45,760
巴尼:好吧,从前有个睡美人,
Barney: Ok, once upon a time there was a sleeping beauty,

314
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:51,800
英俊的王子必须打开一扇正确的门,才能用吻来唤醒她.噢,
and a handsome prince had to open the right door, to wake her with a kiss.

315
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:58,200
抱歉,不是这扇.
Sorry, wrong door.

316
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:04,280
Find the queen, where's she hiding, upstairs downstairs, in my lady's chamber

317
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:10,800
还是在夫人的房间里?运气不好,孩子.再来.
Tough luck kid, try again.

318
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:20,000
迈克:放弃吧,卢克.你自己说过,没人能赢他.
Mike: Face it Luke, you said it yourself, nobody can beat this guy.

319
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:31,300
亚伯:我选这张,因为如果这张是2,
Abe: I choose this one, because if this is the two, and this is the seven,

320
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:32,300
这张是,那这张一定是Q.
then this must be the queen.

321
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:34,800
每个人:嘿,对啊,对.
Everybody: Hey, all right, yeah.

322
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:39,000
麦琪:如果大家玩完了游戏,到厨房去.每个人都去,卢克留下.
Maggie: So if everybody is finished playing games, in the kitchen.Everyone except Luke

323
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,500
杰森:我去拿叉子.
Jason: I'll get the forks.

324
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:42,400
迈克和本:好.
Mike and Ben: Right.

325
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:50,200
德怀特:我去拿盘子和奶油爆米花.
Dwight: I'll get the plates and the cream corn.

326
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:52,300
巴尼:你一直都知道吗?
Barney: You knew the whole time?

327
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:56,800
亚伯:实际上,我真的以为你是个世界上唯一诚实的"三张牌"玩家.
Abe: Actually I really thought you were the worlds only honest three card Monty player

328
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:05,100
巴尼:好,给你戒指.嘿,听着,
Barney: Yep, here's your ring.Hey look, kid it's part of life on the street.

329
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:09,100
孩子,这就是流浪街头的结果.有时候,为了活下去,你不得不把诚实放到一边.
See there comes a time when you have to put your priorities at work.

330
00:20:10,780 --> 00:20:14,060
亚伯:但这仍然改变了你做了错事这个事实.嘿,
Abe: That still doesn't change the fact that this kind of stuff is wrong.

331
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:19,600
你为什么不去找份工作.你知道?重新开始.
Hey, why don't you get a job, you know?Start over.

332
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:22,880
巴尼:说起来容易.我这副尊容,
Barney: That's easy for you to say,

333
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:25,620
招工部门连看都不看我一眼.
I don't exactly have the look the employment agencies want.

334
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:31,900
亚伯:给你.
Abe: Here.

335
00:20:31,900 --> 00:20:33,800
巴尼:这是干什么?
Barney: What's this for?

336
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:36,600
亚伯:留个纪念.
Abe: Something to remember me by.

337
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:43,100
巴尼:哦,这会让那些家伙们开心的.你不介意我…
Barney: Hmm, this should impress the guys.Mind if I...

338
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:46,200
亚伯:去当了吧.
Abe: Go ahead and pawn it.

339
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:49,160
换来的钱可以让你几个星期不愁吃饭.嘿,
It should get you a few weeks downtown and some food.

340
00:20:50,260 --> 00:20:52,980
还能买几件衣服面试的时候用.
Hey, and some clothes for job interviews.

341
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:16,100
巴尼:谢谢你,亚伯.多保重,生日快乐.
Barney: Thanks Abe.Take care of yourself, happy birthday.

342
00:21:18,260 --> 00:21:28,120
每个人:祝你生日快乐,祝你生日快乐,
Everybody: Happy birthday to you, happy birthday dear Luke,

343
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:32,300
亲爱的卢克,祝你生日快乐.
happy birthday to you.

344
00:21:32,300 --> 00:21:33,800
杰森:巴尼走了?
Jason: Did Barney leave already?

345
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:35,100
亚伯:是的,他走了.
Abe: Yeah he just left.

346
00:21:35,100 --> 00:21:45,300
麦琪:过来,小寿星,吹蜡烛吧.
Maggie: Well come on birthday boy, blow out your candles.

347
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:47,500
亚伯:哦,不,谢谢.我一点都不饿.
Abe: Oh no thanks, I'm not really that hungry.

348
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:48,800
杰森:出什么事了?
Jason: Something wrong?

349
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:49,500
亚伯:没有.
Abe: No.

350
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:51,300
德怀特:噢,我知道了.
Dwight: Oh, I know what it is.

351
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:56,800
每次聚会后我都失落,气球开始漏气,
I always get depressed after parties, the balloons start to deflate,

352
00:21:57,240 --> 00:22:01,140
客人们都离去,欢笑都结束了…
the guests all leave, water picks all get put away...

353
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:05,400
请原谅我眼睛里有东西.
Excuse me; I have something in my eye.

354
00:22:07,140 --> 00:22:09,100
麦琪:噢,行了,
Maggie: Oh come on its not over yet,

355
00:22:09,100 --> 00:22:09,700
还没有结束呢.卢克,有些礼物你还没有打开看呢?
Luke you haven't even finished opening your presents.

356
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:11,400
亚伯:不,我都看了.
Abe: Yes I have.

357
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:17,300
杰森:不,还有这个.
Jason: Not this one.

358
00:22:17,300 --> 00:22:18,400
亚伯:哦,这是什么?
Abe: Well, what is it?

359
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:22,400
杰森:这是一张存折,你上大学用的.
Jason: That's a savings bond, for college.

360
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:24,600
亚伯:你们大家不必对我这么好.
Abe: You guys don't have to do this for me.

361
00:22:26,620 --> 00:22:28,160
杰森:哦,我们这样做不是因为不得不这样,
Jason: Well we didn't do it because we have to Luke,

362
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:30,100
卢克,是以为你是这个家庭的一份子.
we did it because you are part of this family.

363
00:22:30,100 --> 00:22:31,600
麦琪:生日快乐.
每个人:生日快乐,卢克.
00:22:31,600
Maggie: Happy birthday. Everybody: Happy birthday Luke.
